Subject: [PATCH] Publish the canonical combined configuration schema

Base: openai/codex rust-v0.162.1 (092d3acd6bec3e3a14bdc7e7a2810ab628ab759d). Prerequisite: the complete preceding runtime and build patch queue. scripts/apply-patches.sh applies this shared generated fixture last.

The real schema CLI regression resolves binaries and resources through the maintained cargo-bin helpers, so manifest-only Windows runfiles are usable. Register its dev-dependency here rather than depending on schema changes before this patch applies. Preserve exact byte and semantic fixture comparisons, including CRLF normalization.

Regression evidence: native jobs 116473691446 and 116520488151 reproduce unresolved paths; the complete schema test pair passes with these resolvers. Full ordered-queue application is the release preparation gate.
